    "enUS": {
      "description": "During our last skirmish with the blood elves, my tent was badly damaged. For three nights, I have been at the mercy of the elements.\r\n\r\nIt can be repaired with a few mosshoof hides, but a lack of sleep has left me unable to hunt them myself.\r\n\r\nThe easiest mosshooves to hunt are west and south of here, but the hide of any mooshoof will do.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Mosshoof Hide",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
